  "body": "## What's Changed\n* Add read-only mode to WorkflowEditor by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/171\n* Update dependency python to v3.14.8 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/161\n* Add lookback property to receive-event nodes by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/174\n* Add optional correlationKey to receive-event nodes by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/172\n* Add timeout support to receive-event nodes by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/173\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/compare/v2.5.0...v2.6.0",
